.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH run 1  "run " 
.SH NAME
run \- One\-shot generation: `runa run <model> [prompt]`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrun\fR [\fB\-\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-ctx\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-tokens\fR] [\fB\-\-temperature\fR] [\fB\-\-seed\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-on\-unfit\fR] [\fB\-\-n\-cpu\-moe\fR] [\fB\-\-prompt\-cache\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-prompt\-cache\fR] [\fB\-\-kv\fR] [\fB\-\-kv\-k\fR] [\fB\-\-kv\-v\fR] [\fB\-\-think\fR] [\fB\-\-think\-budget\fR] [\fB\-\-effort\fR] [\fB\-\-show\-reasoning\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-show\-reasoning\fR] [\fB\-\-device\fR] [\fB\-\-tensor\-split\fR] [\fB\-\-audio\fR] [\fB\-\-mmproj\fR] [\fB\-\-audio\-route\fR] [\fB\-\-image\fR] [\fB\-\-video\fR] [\fB\-\-ngram\fR] [\fB\-\-draft\fR] [\fB\-\-lora\fR] [\fB\-\-json\-schema\fR] [\fB\-\-grammar\fR] [\fB\-\-mcp\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-tool\-rounds\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIMODEL\fR> [\fIPROMPT\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
One\-shot generation: `runa run <model> [prompt]`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-mode\fR \fI<MODE>\fR [default: auto]
Compute mode: cpu | gpu | hybrid | auto (default: auto)
.TP
\fB\-\-ctx\fR \fI<CTX>\fR [default: 8192]
Context length
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-tokens\fR \fI<MAX_TOKENS>\fR [default: 512]
Max new tokens
.TP
\fB\-\-temperature\fR \fI<TEMPERATURE>\fR [default: 0.8]
Sampling temperature (<= 0 = greedy)
.TP
\fB\-\-seed\fR \fI<SEED>\fR [default: 42]
Sampler seed
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit one JSON object instead of streaming text
.TP
\fB\-\-on\-unfit\fR \fI<ON_UNFIT>\fR
When auto cannot fit: error | cpu | cloud:<backend>:<model> (D12)
.TP
\fB\-\-n\-cpu\-moe\fR \fI<N>\fR
Keep MoE expert tensors of the first N layers on CPU (`\-\-n\-cpu\-moe`)
.TP
\fB\-\-prompt\-cache\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
LMDB dir for prompt KV cache (default: ~/.cache/runa/kv)
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-prompt\-cache\fR
Disable the LMDB prompt cache (P2.8)
.TP
\fB\-\-kv\fR \fI<TYPE>\fR
KV cache type for both K and V (`f16`, `q8_0`, `q4_0`). Requires flash\-attn
.TP
\fB\-\-kv\-k\fR \fI<TYPE>\fR
KV type for K only (overrides `\-\-kv`)
.TP
\fB\-\-kv\-v\fR \fI<TYPE>\fR
KV type for V only (overrides `\-\-kv`)
.TP
\fB\-\-think\fR \fI<on|off>\fR
Thinking: on | off (P3.1). Budget/effort override `on`
.TP
\fB\-\-think\-budget\fR \fI<N>\fR
Reasoning token budget (`ThinkMode::Budget`)
.TP
\fB\-\-effort\fR \fI<LEVEL>\fR
Effort level: low | medium | high | max
.TP
\fB\-\-show\-reasoning\fR
Print reasoning (`Event::Reasoning` lands in P3.2)
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-show\-reasoning\fR
Hide reasoning even if config `[think] show = true`
.TP
\fB\-\-device\fR \fI<LIST>\fR
ggml backends to use (`0,1` or `CUDA0,CUDA1`)
.TP
\fB\-\-tensor\-split\fR \fI<LIST>\fR
Per\-GPU proportions (`3,1`). Requires multiple GPUs
.TP
\fB\-\-audio\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Audio file (PCM 16 kHz). Routed by `\-\-audio\-route`
.TP
\fB\-\-mmproj\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Audio/vision mmproj GGUF. Sibling `*mmproj*.gguf` if `\-\-audio` and omitted
.TP
\fB\-\-audio\-route\fR \fI<auto|native|asr>\fR
Audio route: auto | native | asr (P4.4)
.TP
\fB\-\-image\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Image file(s) for native mtmd vision (P4.6)
.TP
\fB\-\-video\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Video file: sampled frames with `[t=12.0s]` markers (P4.6)
.TP
\fB\-\-ngram\fR
Trigram speculative decoding; greedy\-verified (use \-\-temperature 0)
.TP
\fB\-\-draft\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Draft\-model GGUF: counted in fit; speculation still uses n\-gram
.TP
\fB\-\-lora\fR \fI<PATH[:SCALE]>\fR
LoRA adapter GGUF (`path[:scale]`). Repeatable; adds to `[model]` / `[models]` `lora` in config, counted in fit (P8.5)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\-schema\fR \fI<FILE|JSON>\fR
Constrain the answer to a JSON Schema (file path or inline JSON)
.TP
\fB\-\-grammar\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Constrain the answer to a GBNF grammar file
.TP
\fB\-\-mcp\fR \fI<COMMAND>\fR
Stdio MCP server whose tools the model may call: \*(Aq<command args>\*(Aq (repeatable; adds to `[mcp.servers]` in config)
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-tool\-rounds\fR \fI<N>\fR [default: 8]
Stop after this many tool\-call rounds without an answer
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIMODEL\fR>
Local GGUF file (`hf:` refs need `runa pull`, P2.4)
.TP
[\fIPROMPT\fR]
Prompt text (else read from stdin when piped)
